    "sections": {
        "description": "Agencyfy is a modern, powerful, and responsive multipurpose WordPress theme for all business websites. The theme provides unique designs with advanced customizer settings. It can handle businesses, agencies, consultants, corporate, business promotion, online agencies, marketing, SEO, corporate business, law, branding development, entrepreneur, UI/UX Design, startup company and offline firms, lawyers, photography, websites such as. It comes packed with powerful features for designing and customizing theme pages, advanced typography, sticky menu, header styles, logo upload, translation ready (WPML, Polylang), built with SEO in mind and, it's built to be beautiful on all screen sizes. This theme supports the best Elementor page builder for creating, editing, and updating page designs as per the requirement. Agencyfy also supports popular free and premium WordPress plugins such as Elementor, Yoast SEO, WooCommerce, Contact Form 7, Jetpack, Google Analytics, and much more. Check the demo of Agencyfy Pro https://aasta-pro-seven.themearile.com/."
    },
